ue wrenches (Frames 7–10, 21–23).\n- Lifting equipment (Frame 12: hoist used to lift a component).\n- Hand tools for bolt tightening.\n- Engine stand holding the block securely.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ 6) Multiple workers collaborating\n**Confirmed.** Frames 3–6 clearly show two workers standing on opposite sides of the engine, coordinating their work — one appears to be guiding or holding a component while the other adjusts or inspects.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ Final Verdict:\n**The answer “They are installing the turbochargers” is NOT correct.**\n\nThe visual evidence shows workers assembling the **cylinder head and installing the valve cover** — a critical part of the engine’s valvetrain assembly — but **no turbochargers are visible or being installed** in these frames. The focus is on internal engine components, not forced induction systems.\n\n---\n\n### 💡 Correct Answer:\n**They are assembling the engine’s cylinder head and installing the valve cover.**"}], 'formatted_responses': ['\n=== Batch 0-30 (30 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0756.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0757.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0758.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0759.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0760.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0761.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0762.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0763.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0764.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0765.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0766.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0767.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/ihfjEFGdZdc/frames/frame_0768.jpg, /mnt/ssd/da